<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola FEMSA raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola FEMSA raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has raised its rating for Mexican bottler Coca-Cola FEMSA SA to outperform from neutral, a source at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in the company closed on Tuesday at 35.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
